OL,3,GNEWSA'I'll announce a new health
OL,4,Aminister on Thursday,' says Burrows,
OL,5,Aafter Nesbitt row
OL,6,
OL,7,FUlster Unionist leader Jon Burrows has
OL,8,Fsaid he will make a decision
OL,9,F"overnight" and confirm on Thursday who
OL,10,Fwill replace Mike Nesbitt as health
OL,11,Fminister.
OL,13,FIt comes after Nesbitt resigned amid a
OL,14,Frow with Jon Burrows.
OL,16,FThe decision came following a clash
OL,17,Fover withdrawing emergency general
OL,18,Fsurgery services from Causeway Hospital
OL,19,Fwhere Nesbitt said the party leader had
OL,20,F"introduced a second red line".
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
