OL,3,GNEWSA'I'll announce a new health
OL,4,Aminister on Thursday,' says Burrows,
OL,5,Aafter Nesbitt row
OL,6,
OL,7,FBurrows said he was "disappointed"
OL,8,FNesbitt had quit but pledged his
OL,9,Freplacement in the Stormont executive
OL,10,Fjob would "get going with gusto".
